        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bahungu barakura; Esau aba umuhigi w’umuhinga, w’ umunyeshamba; Yakobo we yaratekereza, yībēra mu mahema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.27",
